{"v":1,"book":"Prov","ch":25,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"These also are proverbs of Solomon, which the men of Hezekiah the king of Judah copied.","tok":[{"t":"These also are "},{"t":"proverbs","s":["H4912"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Solomon","s":["H8010"],"a":[3]},{"t":", which the "},{"t":"men","s":["H0582"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Hezekiah","s":["H2396"],"a":[7]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[8]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"copied","s":["H6275"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"It is the glory of God to conceal a matter, But the glory of kings is to search a matter out.","tok":[{"t":"It is the "},{"t":"glory","s":["H3519"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[1]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"conceal","s":["H5641"],"a":[2]},{"t":" a matter, But the glory of "},{"t":"kings","s":["H4428"],"a":[5]},{"t":" is to "},{"t":"search","s":["H2713"],"a":[6]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"matter","s":["H1697"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"out","s":["H2713"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"As the heavens for height, and the earth for depth, So the heart of kings is unsearchable.","tok":[{"t":"As the "},{"t":"heavens","s":["H8064"],"a":[0]},{"t":" for "},{"t":"height","s":["H7312"],"a":[1]},{"t":", and the "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[2]},{"t":" for "},{"t":"depth","s":["H6011"],"a":[3]},{"t":", So the "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"kings","s":["H4428"],"a":[5]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"unsearchable","s":["H2714"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"Take away the dross from the silver, And a vessel comes out for the smith;","tok":[{"t":"Take "},{"t":"away","s":["H1898"],"a":[0]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"dross","s":["H5509"],"a":[1]},{"t":" from the "},{"t":"silver","s":["H3701"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And a "},{"t":"vessel","s":["H3627"],"a":[5]},{"t":" comes out for the smith;"}]},{"n":5,"text":"Take away the wicked man from before the king, And his throne will be established in righteousness.","tok":[{"t":"Take